# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Real substation data is NOT committed.
#
# This repository is public. The disturbance records, the Siemens .rio
# settings export and the event PDFs in this working directory are live
# operational data from a 220 kV transmission line: relay settings, CT/VT
# ratios, fault currents and protection behaviour. They stay local.
#
# The test suite is written so that every test touching them skips cleanly
# when they are absent (see tests/test_real_records.py, needs_corpus).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
DR & Events */
DR */
DR1/
dr/
*.CFG
*.cfg
*.DAT
*.dat
*.CFF
*.cff
*.rio
*.RIO
*.pdf
!data/registry/*.yaml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# trained model artefacts - regenerate with `dranalyse train`
models/
*.pkl

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and tools
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.qodo/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets / site configuration (added alongside the data rules above)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
*.pem
*.key
